  "answer": "Based on the research, I now have all three 2023 THE subject ranking top-10 lists and the Russell Group membership. Let me analyze the intersection.\n\n## Analysis\n\n### 2023 THE Clinical and Health Top 10 (Russell Group members in bold)\n1. **University of Oxford** ✓\n2. **University of Cambridge** ✓\n3. Harvard University\n4. **Imperial College London** ✓\n5. Tsinghua University\n6. Stanford University\n7. University of Toronto\n8. **UCL** ✓\n9. Yale University\n10. **King's College London** ✓\n\n### 2023 THE Arts and Humanities Top 10 (Russell Group members in bold)\n1. Stanford University\n2. MIT\n3. **University of Cambridge** ✓\n4. **University of Oxford** ✓\n5. Harvard University\n6. **UCL** ✓\n7. Princeton University\n8. UC Berkeley\n9. **University of Edinburgh** ✓\n10. University of Chicago\n\n### 2023 THE Psychology Top 10 (Russell Group members in bold)\n1. Stanford University\n2. **University of Cambridge** ✓\n3. Princeton University\n4. **UCL** ✓\n5. Harvard University\n6. UC Berkeley\n7. Yale University\n8. **King's College London** ✓\n9. University of Pennsylvania\n10. University of Michigan–Ann Arbor\n\n### Intersection — Russell Group universities in **all three** top 10s\n\n| University | Clinical & Health | Arts & Humanities | Psychology |\n|------------|-------------------|-------------------|------------|\n| **University of Cambridge** | #2 | #3 | #2 |\n| **UCL (University College London)** | #8 | #6 | #4 |\n\n---\n\n**Answer: Two Russell Group universities appear in the top 10 for all three subjects in the 2023 THE rankings:**\n\n1. **University of Cambridge**\n2. **UCL (University College London)**\n\n---\n\n## Sources\n\n- 2023 THE Clinical and Health subject ranking: https://www.timeshighereducation.com/press-releases/world-university-rankings-2023-subject-released\n- 2023 THE Arts and Humanities subject ranking: https://www.timeshighereducation.com/press-releases/world-university-rankings-2023-subject-released\n- 2023 THE Psychology subject ranking: https://www.timeshighereducation.com/press-releases/world-university-rankings-2023-subject-released\n- Russell Group membership list: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russell_Group",
